    <item>
      <title>All 4 Suppliers Unlock Guide: Ingredients and Dead Drop Locations</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/schedule-i/npc/suppliers/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 09 Jun 2026 02:40:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/schedule-i/npc/suppliers/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;callout&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Short answer:&lt;/strong&gt; There are 4 named suppliers in Schedule 1: Albert Hoover (weed seeds), Shirley Watts (pseudo for meth), Fungal Phil (shroom supplies), and Salvador Moreno (coca seeds). Each is unlocked by reaching Friendly status with one of their connections, then using Dead Drop orders to build relationship. Dan&#39;s Hardware is a shop (not a supplier NPC) -- the actual NPC shopkeeper is Dan Samwell.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;section-heading&#34;&gt;All 4 Suppliers Reference&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;table&gt;&#xA;  &lt;thead&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Portrait&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Supplier&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Region&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Products Sold&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Unlock Connection&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/thead&gt;&#xA;  &lt;tbody&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/screenshots/schedule-i/npc/albert.png&#34; alt=&#34;Albert Hoover&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Albert Hoover&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Northtown&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Marijuana Seeds (all tiers)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Available from start&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/screenshots/schedule-i/npc/shirley.png&#34; alt=&#34;Shirley Watts&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Shirley Watts&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Westville&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Pseudo (meth precursor)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Elizabeth Homley or Kevin Oakley&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/screenshots/schedule-i/npc/fungalphil.png&#34; alt=&#34;Fungal Phil&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Fungal Phil&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Downtown&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Shroom spores and supplies&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Elizabeth Homley or Kevin Oakley&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/screenshots/schedule-i/npc/salvador.png&#34; alt=&#34;Salvador Moreno&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Salvador Moreno&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Docks&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Coca Plant Seeds&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Higher rank connections&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/tbody&gt;&#xA;&lt;/table&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;section-heading&#34;&gt;How to Unlock Each Supplier&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Suppliers are unlocked by reaching &lt;strong&gt;Friendly&lt;/strong&gt; status with one of their connections. You cannot unlock them just by finding their stash location.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>All 6 Dealers: Best Customer Assignments for Max Profit</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/schedule-i/npc/dealers/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 09 Jun 2026 02:50:00 +0800</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/schedule-i/npc/dealers/</guid>
      <description>&lt;div class=&#34;callout&#34;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Short answer:&lt;/strong&gt; There are 6 dealers in Schedule 1: Benji Coleman, Molly Presley, Brad Crosby, Jane Lucero, Wei Long, and Leo Rivers. Each requires a buy-in ($500-$5,000) and unlocks at specific rank thresholds. Assign 8-10 customers per dealer. Prioritize low-spending customers for dealers -- keep your high-spending customers for direct sales. Since v0.4.3, dealers can serve 10 customers each.&lt;/div&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;section-heading&#34;&gt;All 6 Dealers Reference&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;table&gt;&#xA;  &lt;thead&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Portrait&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Dealer&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Location&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Buy-In&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Cut&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Unlock Rank&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;          &lt;th&gt;Max Customers&lt;/th&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/thead&gt;&#xA;  &lt;tbody&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/screenshots/schedule-i/npc/benji.png&#34; alt=&#34;Benji Coleman&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Benji Coleman&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Northtown, Motel Room #2&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;$500&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;20%&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Tutorial&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;10 (8 pre-v0.4.3)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/screenshots/schedule-i/npc/molly.png&#34; alt=&#34;Molly Presley&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Molly Presley&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Westville, Brown Apartment&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;$1,000&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;20%&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Hoodlum I&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;10 (8)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/screenshots/schedule-i/npc/brad.png&#34; alt=&#34;Brad Crosby&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Brad Crosby&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Downtown, Parking Garage (under overpass)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;$2,000&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;20%&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Hustler I&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;10 (8)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/screenshots/schedule-i/npc/jane.png&#34; alt=&#34;Jane Lucero&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Jane Lucero&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Docks, Docks RV&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;$3,000&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;20%&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Enforcer I&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;10 (8)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/screenshots/schedule-i/npc/wei.png&#34; alt=&#34;Wei Long&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Wei Long&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Suburbia, Shack behind green house&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;$4,000&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;20%&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Block Boss I&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;10 (8)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;      &lt;tr&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;&lt;img src=&#34;http://localhost:1313/images/screenshots/schedule-i/npc/leo.png&#34; alt=&#34;Leo Rivers&#34;&gt;&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Leo Rivers&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Near Church&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;$5,000&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;20%&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;Kingpin I&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;          &lt;td&gt;10 (8)&lt;/td&gt;&#xA;      &lt;/tr&gt;&#xA;  &lt;/tbody&gt;&#xA;&lt;/table&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 class=&#34;section-heading&#34;&gt;How to Unlock Each Dealer&lt;/h2&gt;&#xD;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Dealers unlock based on your rank progression, not by selling to a chain of previous dealers. Each dealer appears when you reach the required rank.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
